{"reviews":[{"review_id":"0ab8ce94-d3a5-45fb-b754-ecedfd8be90c","review_text":"Never Fight against our religious values!"},{"review_id":"d02d846e-a307-4310-b72b-4a9bd7a7aa77","review_text":"Spotify has enjoyable and songs with lyrics"},{"review_id":"548a1925-3343-452f-817c-f5b77f527fb4","review_text":"Turns on by itself, very annoying, no obvious way to stop it except to hit pause after it starts......or just delete the app"},{"review_id":"f12e8c11-d326-4d49-8226-3e9907a8c719","review_text":"Spotify has removed the best way to discover new music. 

Like many people, I organize my music in playlists by genre. Then I listen to dynamic radio stations based on those playlists. Now Spotify has removed this Playlist Radio feature for no apparent reason. 

Discover Weekly is nice, but is a mish-mash of genres over which you have no control. There are Daily Mixes, but these definitely do not refresh daily. And again, no control over the genres."},{"review_id":"7d851e26-b2b6-4bdc-a707-5f56e56e627e","review_text":"Love this app but it's sad that it sometimes doesn't have the music I want but it usually has everything and I even end up finding songs from my childhood"},{"review_id":"f891797e-8e43-40e9-b53c-4b70eedf0ef0","review_text":"Ads are coming after 1 song..."},{"review_id":"00f3744c-20bf-4c18-bb5f-693c718da69a","review_text":"Such a great music source. I can play entire albums by my favorite bands, or let the app pick a variety of songs by them. Can listen by genre. Plus I can pill up specific books of the Bible to listen to. So worth having. And I have not heard one add."},{"review_id":"453c0564-abc1-498f-a25f-de789c4c34da","review_text":"Love it, allows me to indulge my passion for old and new music"},{"review_id":"b7ff6ed5-d7f1-4d50-b6d7-97edaeb96ec9","review_text":"Ah they removed a basic feature like seek and made it exclusive for Premium users. Pathetic app"},{"review_id":"41e15ed0-2ee4-4f3a-9a60-c4eb45de3fbe","review_text":"this app is good for playing music 🎶"}]}
